# JSON Lines gateway logs and triage reports. Both carry real hostnames, real paths
# and real client addresses, so a stray commit of one leaks more than any
# configuration file would. The triage tool writes its report into the current
# directory by default, which for anyone running it from a clone is this one.
logs/
*.jsonl
